{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35575","headline":"寒食山馆书情 · 来鹄","name":"寒食山馆书情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独把一杯山馆中，每经时节恨飘蓬。\n侵堦草色连朝雨，满地梨花昨夜风。\n蜀魄啼来春寂寞，楚魂吟後月朦胧。\n分明记得还家梦，徐孺宅前湖水东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"来鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}